  "query_preview": "/Saturday through Wednesday/...\nThe weekend will bring further warming as an upper ridge expands \nnorthward from the Desert SW. A weak disturbance forecast to\ntrack through the northern Great Basin on Monday will bring a\nlow chance of showers and possibly a thunderstorm to areas along\nthe northern NV border and into s-central Idaho mtns. Otherwise\nwarm and dry conditions will continue through the middle of \nnext week with high temperatures holding 10-15 degrees above \nnormal (low-mid 80s at lower elevations).",
